*kubernetes 

clientset: it is set of clients that can be used to interact with r esources to interact with different api versions. 
example,
1. pod resource - core/v1 api version, call vore/v1 from client set to perform the HTTP Action methods. 
2. Deployment resources - apps/v1 api version 

how to get list of all api version and the respective resources?
kubectl api-resources 


